WEBVTT

00:26:00.246 --> 00:26:03.246
was about trying to find
love in this weird way,

00:26:03.246 --> 00:26:06.288
trying to show the world
this woman's life meant

00:26:06.288 --> 00:26:11.413
so much that I'm going to ruin
mine to honor her. Mm hmm.

00:26:11.454 --> 00:26:17.788
And I wanted to ask you about that
destructive thing that we do.

00:26:18.163 --> 00:26:21.663
Why do you think we hurt ourselves
when we're hurt

00:26:21.829 --> 00:26:22.829
? Mm.

00:26:24.829 --> 00:26:28.496
Well, again, you you with the
big questions, Debbie,